<event start="TLI_45" end="TLI_46">(1.77) </event>
<event start="TLI_46" end="TLI_47">das wor awer noch ganz nass. </event>
<event start="TLI_47" end="TLI_48">mer kunnten den Dog no nix machen. </event>
<event start="TLI_48" end="TLI_49">(1.32) </event>
