<event start="TLI_54" end="TLI_55">(0.76) </event>
<event start="TLI_55" end="TLI_56">un hon dann er mo aangemieht.</event>
<event start="TLI_56" end="TLI_57">(0.2)</event>
<event start="TLI_57" end="TLI_59">na, dann hon mer Mittag ho mer n Bänger gehult, </event>
