<event start="TLI_117" end="TLI_118">(0.85) </event>
<event start="TLI_118" end="TLI_119">da hatt mer au noch en ganz schenes Stick abgemach. </event>
<event start="TLI_119" end="TLI_120">(0.16) </event>
