<event start="TLI_222" end="TLI_223">(1.27) </event>
<event start="TLI_223" end="TLI_224">un de Sunndag gab s dann orndlich Rain. </event>
<event start="TLI_224" end="TLI_225">(1.74) </event>
<event start="TLI_225" end="TLI_226">es war jo gut, </event>
